==History==
2023
*The Knight's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game with the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (7/8/2023)|August 2023 Update]] on 7/8/2023{{Balance|Add}}.
*On 24/8/2023, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (24/8/2023)|maintenance break]] decreased the Evolved Knight's damage reduction shield to 60% (from 80%){{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 3/10/2023, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/10/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Knight's hitpoints to 120% of the original's (from 130%){{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 13/11/2023, a [[Version History#Minor Update (13/11/2023)|Minor Update]] increased the Evolved Knight's attack period to 1.1 seconds (from 0.9 seconds){{Balance|Nerf}}.
2024
*On 5/3/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]] increased the Evolved Knight’s attack period to 1.2 seconds (from 1.1 seconds){{Balance|Nerf}} and removed the Evolved Knight’s extra damage{{Balance|Remove}}.
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]] decreased the Evolved Knight's hitpoints to 110% of the original's (from 120%){{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]] removed the Evolved Knight's extra hitpoints{{Balance|Remove}}. It also fixed certain issues with damage multipliers on the Evolved Knight{{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 2/10/2024, the [[Version History#Lucky Drops 2.0 Update (2/10/2024)|Lucky Drops 2.0 Update]] changed the card description. It used to say, "''Not only has his facial hair got an upgrade, the knight’s armor has too! While moving, an evolved Knight gains a special shield and is stronger in melee combat.''{{Balance|Neutral}}"
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]] added a sound effect to the Evolved Knight after death{{Balance|Neutral}}. It also fixed a bug where the Evolved Knight would occasionally take 100% damage while chasing a troop after attacking{{Balance|Neutral}}.
2025
* On 24/11/2025, the [[Version History#Level 16 Update (24/11/2025)|Level 16 Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 16 (from 15){{Balance|Buff}}.

