==Trivia==
*The word ''"Knight"'' comes from the German "''Knecht"'', meaning servant or vassal. Originally, knights were associated with mounted warriors, later being considered a class of lower nobility, until eventually, knighthood had become associated with the ideals of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chivalry chivalry], a code of conduct for the perfect courtly Christian warrior. Often, a knight was a vassal who served as an elite fighter or a bodyguard for a lord, with payment in the form of land holdings.
*Along with [[Barbarians/Evolution|Barbarians]] and the [[Lumberjack/Evolution|Lumberjack]], he is voice acted by [https://www.imdb.com/name/nm1423395/ John Mondelli].
**According to John Mondelli, the Knight has a French accent.
*While not available as a character, the Knight's sounds, along with Barbarians', [[Wizard]]'s, and the [[Dark Prince]]'s, are featured in the [https://beatstar.fandom.com/wiki/Clash_Royale_Theme Clash Royale Theme] [https://beatstar.fandom.com/wiki/Songs song] in Beatstar.
*The Knight's Evolution is the subject of a few cosmetics in the game. More specifically:
**The Knight's Evolution is the subject of an [[Emotes|Emote]].
**The Knight's Evolution is the subject of a [[Battle Banners|Battle Banner]] frame.
*The initial balance change for Evolved Knight on the [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|14/5/2024 Balance Update]] was a hitpoints decrease to 110% of the original's and an increase to the damage reduction shield to 70% (from 60%), but the damage reduction shield increase [https://royaleapi.com/blog/season-59-balance-wip was pulled back last minute].

